{
  "mod": {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 2407,
      "hub_id": null,
      "guid": "com.lacyway.csf",
      "name": "QuickSellFlea",
      "slug": "quicksellflea",
      "teaser": "Tired of placing orders on the flea? Tired of having to install 20 mods to quick sell on flea? Now you can instantly place it with the average price - with just ONE click and no other mods needed!",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/DKD1Wl0DKh0VvDfyq0nyMHxCBwC3HhPhiOMirGIG.png",
      "downloads": 32395,
      "favourites_count": 75,
      "description": "<p>When in your main menu stash, or hideout, hold <strong>CTRL</strong> (default, can be changed) and right-click an item to post it on the flea with the average price. 100% client-sided, no server mod or other dependencies needed.</p>\n<p>You can toggle whether to show listing price or average price in the tooltip in the F12 menu.</p>\n<p>The idea came from <strong>Simdola</strong>, who tried other similar mods. The problem is that they require either a server side component, or another mod to be used. This mod is very simple, performant, safe and has very little interference with base game logic.</p>\n<h3>New with 1.3.0</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Added UIFixes multi-select integration (thank you <strong>tyfon</strong> for being awesome)</li>\n<li>Added 2 new options:\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Bypass Limit</strong>: The mod will now ignore your post limit on the flea</li>\n<li><strong>Hotkey</strong>: The hotkey to hold down to show the interaction</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>New with 1.1.3</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>You can now choose the currency you want to list in\n<ul>\n<li>The mod automatically calculates the average price of the currency</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>New with 1.1.0</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>You can now hold SHIFT while posting to post <em><strong>all</strong></em> items of similar type</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The text will show ([1s, 10x] 1000) where S represents stacks, X amount (e.g. for stackable ammo) and 1000 is the total gain from posting it (or listing price, depending on your settings).\n\n</p>\n<h3>Limitations:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>You can only place the same amount that you are restricted to on the flea (the button won’t appear otherwise)</li>\n<li>If you right-click a stacked item, it will always place the full stack. Split before posting</li>\n<li>This does not let you post normally flea-restricted items</li>\n<li>This does not bypass FiR requirements for the flea</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bugs:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Sometimes the SPT server doesn’t execute the callback properly, this happens even without the mod. If you see a flashing item you need to restart the game. This needs to be fixed by the SPT development team. (as of <code>1.3.1</code> this has been fixed with a workaround)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You can support me on Ko-Fi</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/lacyway\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click</a></p>\n",
      "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2407/quicksellflea",
