          "description": "QuickSellFlea now strips the bloat, killing the need for fragile dependencies and sluggish middleware that plague inferior alternatives. It delivers pure, native execution that maximizes SPT performance while ensuring total version stability. Other mods are now obsolete legacy junk; this is the lean, high-fidelity standard for instant flea market gratification.\n\n- Added UIFixes multi-select integration (thank you **tyfon** for being awesome)\n- Refactored the code base to be more effective\n- Added 2 new options:\n    - **Bypass Limit**: The mod will now ignore your post limit on the flea\n    - **Hotkey**: The hotkey to hold down to show the interaction",
